<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Chemistry_2e_(OpenStax)/15:_Equilibria_of_Other_Reaction_Classes/15.01:_Precipitation_and_Dissolution" class="mt-section"><span id="Exercise_.5C(.5CPageIndex.7B6.7D.5C)"></span><h5 class="box-legend lt-chem-414707 editable"><span class="lt-icon-default">Exercise \(\PageIndex{6}\)</span></h5>

